{"type":"plan","title":"夏休みの風鈴","logline":"おばあちゃんの江戸風鈴が、青い短冊と夜風で再び鳴る物語","shots":[{"index":1,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Wide shot of the engawa veranda in summer daylight, Yui walks onto the wooden floor toward Grandma who sits near the shoji screens; the Edo fūrin hangs straight and still from the eaves. Time: summer day, bright sunlight.","mode":"still","dialogue":"夏休み、ゆいは、京都のおばあちゃんの家に、遊びに来ました。","cites":[1,4]},{"index":2,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Medium shot focusing on the fūrin, the glass bell and white paper strip hanging motionless in the gentle breeze, the veranda background blurred. Time: summer day, bright sunlight.","mode":"still","dialogue":"縁側には、古い江戸風鈴が、ひとつ下がっていますが、もう、音が鳴りません。","cites":[1,4]},{"index":3,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Close-up on Grandma's face as she gestures toward the fūrin, Yui looks up attentively from beside her. Time: summer day, bright sunlight.","mode":"still","dialogue":"「おじいちゃんと買った風鈴なの」と、おばあちゃんは、言いました。","cites":[1]},{"index":4,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Wide shot of the Gion festival street at dusk, grey stone pavement glows with lantern light, Yui and Grandma in yukata stroll past rows of stalls. Time: dusk, lantern glow.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"夕方、二人は、浴衣を着て、祇園祭の宵山へ、出かけました。","cites":[2,5]},{"index":5,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Medium shot of a fūrin stall, several glass bells hang from the eaves, their paper strips plain, lanterns flicker. Time: dusk, lantern glow.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"提灯の灯る通りには、屋台が、ずらりと並んでいます。","cites":[2,4,5]},{"index":6,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Close-up of Yui's hand selecting a blue tanzaku strip from the stall, the strip's color vivid against the stall's wood. Time: dusk, lantern glow.","mode":"still","dialogue":"風鈴の屋台で、ゆいは、青い短冊を、一枚選びました。","cites":[2,5,6]},{"index":7,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Medium shot inside the tatami tea-room at night, low table illuminated by a paper lantern, Yui sits writing on the blue strip. Time: night, lantern glow.","mode":"still","dialogue":"夜、家に帰ると、ゆいは、短冊に、願いごとを書きました。","cites":[3]},{"index":8,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Close-up of the blue tanzaku now bearing the wish in delicate brush strokes, the paper rests on the table. Time: night, lantern glow.","mode":"still","dialogue":"「おばあちゃんの風鈴が、また、鳴りますように」。","cites":[3,6]},{"index":9,"shotType":"Low angle","description":"Low angle from the veranda floor showing Yui tying the blue strip to the fūrin's thread, Grandma watches from the side as a night wind stirs the garden. Time: night, gentle breeze.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"ゆいが、短冊を風鈴に結ぶと、夜風が、そっと吹きました。","cites":[1,4,6]},{"index":10,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Close-up of the fūrin now ringing, the glass bell tilted, the blue strip lifted sideways with faint motion lines, a soft 'chirin' resonates. Time: night, gentle breeze.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"ちりん。風鈴が、ひさしぶりに、鳴りました。","cites":[4]},{"index":11,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Medium shot on the veranda, Grandma gently wipes a tear and strokes Yui's head, the fūrin's faint chime lingers in the night air. Time: night, gentle breeze.","mode":"still","dialogue":"おばあちゃんは、そっと涙をふいて、ゆいの頭を、なでました。","cites":[1]}]}
